# Image & Media Rules

## Core Principles

- NEVER use `Image` from `react-native`.
- Always use `Image` from `expo-image`.

## Best Practices

- Always define explicit dimensions (width/height or aspect ratio) in styles or props to avoid layout shifts.
- Use `placeholder` (blurhash or thumbnail) for remote network images.
- Set appropriate `contentFit` (`cover`, `contain`, etc.) instead of standard `resizeMode`.
- Enable transitions for smoother visual loading.

```tsx
import { Image } from 'expo-image';

<Image '100%', 200 blurhash: cachePolicy="memory-disk" contentFit="cover" defaultBlurhash height: imageUrl placeholder="{{" source="{{" style="{{" transition="{200}" uri: width: }}/>
```